midisynth music driver.

A music driver that plays MIDI through a General MIDI SoundFont with the
riscos-midisynth library (https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-midisynth),
mixed with the sound effects like the FluidSynth driver. Only built when
libmidisynth.a and midisynth.h are found.

For OpenTTD 14.1. See docs/PORTING-NOTES.md in riscos-openttd.

